h the Swiss four-man bob. Fahlkvist returned to the 1952 Summer Olympics, wrestling that time in " [:a {:href "/results/123715"} "Greco-Roman as a heavyweight"] ", where he tied for sixth. Wittenberg would win the US AAU title seven times and, at Helsinki in 1952, won the " [:a {:href "/results/123396"} "silver medal in this class"] ". He was also a two-time champion at the Maccabiah Games."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {} "Bad Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "139"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60801"} "Henry Wittenberg"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "135"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59986"} "Fritz Stöckli"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SUI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SUI.png"}] "SUI"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "260"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60028"} "Bengt Fahlkvist"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "122"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/57551"} "Fernand Payette"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-alig